<title>USA: First Bankshares Inc raises qtly dividend.</title>
<headline>First Bankshares Inc raises qtly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>EAST POINT, Ga. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Bankshares Inc, the parent company of First Bank of Georgia, said it raised its quarterly dividend to $0.09 per share from $0.08 previously.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable April 10 to shareholders of record March 31.</p>
</text>
